WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.409
The desert is still.

00:00:02.409 --> 00:00:09.250
The night seems endless, silent, and at peace…
until it’s pierced by the sound of gunshots

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.219
and screams.

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:16.020
Deep in the Sahara, the SCP Foundation is
waging war against a newly discovered enemy.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:21.700
A squad of foundation agents is retreating,
trying to get away from the ones who massacred

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.570
their allies.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:28.100
They were attempting to eliminate the threat
using conventional means, but their rifles

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:33.380
were no match for the reality bending entities
of the Kingdom of Abaddon.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:37.640
The retreating agents cover one another as
they make their way back to the extraction

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.640
point.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.809
The enemy force advances.

00:00:39.809 --> 00:00:44.249
Agents that are caught too close to the sorcerers
of Abaddon disintegrate into thin air.

00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:46.399
This is not an enemy they can defeat.

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:51.079
The SCP agents need to get back to base and
relay what they have found to their superiors.

00:00:51.079 --> 00:00:56.390
Out of the hundreds of agents sent into the
Sahara that night, only a handful make it

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:57.569
out alive.

00:00:57.569 --> 00:01:01.800
They are debriefed by their superiors at the
Foundation who classify the anomalous humanoids

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.929
under the highest of threat levels.

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.670
The Kingdom of Abaddon is a threat.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:11.049
The Kingdom of Abaddon must be eliminated.

00:01:11.049 --> 00:01:14.150
Reconnaissance done prior to the disastrous
mission had alerted the Foundation to the

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:19.090
presence of anomalies in the region, but they
had no idea how strong the anomalous humanoids

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:20.140
would be.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:24.450
From data gathered through old reports, it
seemed that the Abaddon humanoids were responsible

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:30.140
for the deaths of no fewer than 75 Foundation
personnel, and had stolen at least 12 different

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.360
items from the Foundation.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:37.270
The leaders of the SCP Foundation tasked research
team Omega-5 with developing a weapon that

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:41.220
would be capable of destroying the Kingdom
of Abaddon once and for all.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:45.880
The weapon they are researching must be capable
of long range destruction, because the moment

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:50.469
any Foundation agent gets close to the area,
they are vaporized by the reality manipulating

00:01:50.469 --> 00:01:55.590
powers of its inhabitants The project is given
the name “Twins of God” and is led by

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:59.689
a Foundation doctor known only by the designation
“O5-1.”

00:01:59.689 --> 00:02:06.020
O5-1 is popular in the SCP Foundation, well
known for his in-depth research and charismatic

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:09.849
personality, making him the perfect person
to lead such a project.

00:02:09.849 --> 00:02:15.360
And O5-1 recently came across an anomaly that
he believes holds the solution the Foundation

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:19.140
has been looking for to defeat the Kingdom
of Abaddon…

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:23.069
Item-001.And so the Omega-5 team gets to work.

00:02:23.069 --> 00:02:27.380
They discover that the anomaly has incredible
powers when put inside a host, which they

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:32.320
refer to as an Item-001 entity, and set up
a series of experiments using different people

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:36.841
to harness its energy The first series of
tests all end in tragedy.

00:02:36.841 --> 00:02:41.620
The anomaly causes the entity it inhabits
to become intensely radioactive.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:46.599
Anyone who gets close to it succumbs to immediate
radiation sickness, and eventually death.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:51.400
To stop the radiation problems the Omega-5
research group intensifies the containment

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.400
procedures.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:56.730
O5-1 receives reports from the higher ups
that the Kingdom of Abaddon has attacked another

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.030
Foundation facility in Sudan.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.560
Long-range defense is needed A.S.A.P.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:07.120
The administrator puts more pressure on Omega-5,
and especially its leader O5-1, to solve the

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:12.041
problems of Item-001 and develop a weapon
that can save the Foundation.

00:03:12.041 --> 00:03:17.030
He stays awake for days on end, working tirelessly
to create a safe and controllable Item-001

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.660
entity.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:23.069
Although there are signs that the weapon will
work, it is still unpredictable.

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:29.590
When Item-001 is initiated, the host entity
becomes paralyzed, suffers severe cerebral

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:34.530
hemorrhaging, and soon a new host is needed
before testing can begin again.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:37.670
And that’s not the only thing going wrong.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:42.390
Whenever the anomaly is put into a new host,
sudden and random destruction of on-site structures

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:44.200
and personnel takes place.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.360
O5-1 knows though, that if this power can
be harnessed and controlled in the right way,

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:52.959
that it could be the weapon that the Foundation
needs to wipe out the Kingdom of Abaddon once

00:03:52.959 --> 00:03:54.340
and for all.

00:03:54.340 --> 00:04:00.870
In order to control Item-001, O5-1 has a mind-kill
switch implanted in its hosts’ brains.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:06.450
O5-1 can activate the implant to incapacitate
the host and immediately stop the unwanted

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.450
destruction.

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:11.470
Countless hosts are terminated by this mind-kill
switch in the early trials conducted by the

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:17.900
Omega-5 team, but progress continues to be
made and eventually a hypothesis is formulated.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:22.630
Perhaps the disastrous side effects of Item-001
can be offset by spreading the anomaly across

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.180
multiple subjects.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:28.820
They theorize that the immense mental load
of the anomaly can be distributed among several

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:33.590
hosts, thus reducing the toll it takes on
each and giving them the ability to control

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:35.310
its immense power.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:41.449
But O5-1 and the Omega-5 team need more data,
and for that, they need more bodies.

00:04:41.449 --> 00:04:45.810
They consult with the director of Site-17
and it is concluded that the nearby town of

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:50.740
San Marco would be an appropriate place to
get the additional test subjects they require.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:56.320
On a quiet Sunday morning, Omega-5 along with
support from a squad of armed SCP agents storm

00:04:56.320 --> 00:05:00.460
into the San Marcos de la Vida Sterna Church
during the middle of mass.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:05.000
They gather up a number of the younger congregants
and bring them back to the site where Item-001

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.490
is housed.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:11.060
The researchers quickly ran through their
new supply of test subjects though, and Omega-5

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:15.240
would need to get even more if their research
was to continue.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:20.169
Instead of going back and forth between the
testing facility and San Marco, O5-1 decides

00:05:20.169 --> 00:05:24.120
to move the entire Item-001 operation to the
town itself.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:30.250
He renames the town, Testing Site-001, and
Omega-5 rounds up 23 of the healthiest subjects

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.790
they can find for use in the next series of
research tests.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:38.680
A few weeks after occupying the town of San
Marco, Omega-5 makes it’s most substantial

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.420
progress yet.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:45.280
Just as they theorized, by spreading out the
anomaly of Item-001 across a specific group

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.970
of hosts, they can control its powers.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:52.600
The tests may have cost the lives of almost
everyone in the town, but the ends certainly

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.539
justify the means.

00:05:54.539 --> 00:05:59.289
The Kingdom of Abaddon poses an existential
threat to the SCP Foundation after all, and

00:05:59.289 --> 00:06:04.050
thanks to this research they will soon have
a weapon capable of bringing them victory.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:09.979
The Foundation administrator criticizes O5-1’s
methods, but can’t argue with his results.

00:06:09.979 --> 00:06:12.990
Unfortunately, O5-1 has a dark secret.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:17.680
A secret that disturbs even the most hardened
and loyal members of Omega-5.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:21.919
A secret that has to do with the Item-001
hosts.

00:06:21.919 --> 00:06:27.190
The hosts that Omega-5 has made its major
progress with are not the ordinary test subjects

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.270
normally used by the Foundation.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:35.130
No, the test subjects O5-1 makes his breakthrough
with… are children.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:39.889
Nine of them to be exact, all between four
and eleven years old.

00:06:39.889 --> 00:06:45.150
Despite being told specifically by the Foundation
administrator to only test on adults, the

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:49.940
research required O5-1 to break the chain
of command and follow the science down the

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.330
path it led.

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:55.960
The children are contained in a reinforced
bunker where only O5-1, and a select few,

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.110
have access.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:07:00.860
They are technically alive, but are functionally
brain dead.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:06.419
The group of nine children share a hive mind
that can process information, and more importantly,

00:07:06.419 --> 00:07:12.509
can unleash the full potential of the implanted
anomaly, creating and controlling a devastating

00:07:12.509 --> 00:07:13.509
power.

00:07:13.509 --> 00:07:16.300
But not everyone is thrilled with what they’ve
achieved.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.759
Members of Omega-5 are haunted by the screams
of the children that they’ve forced to be

00:07:19.759 --> 00:07:21.710
part of their weapon development program.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:27.229
They describe their merging with Item-001
as being a process that rips out their souls

00:07:27.229 --> 00:07:30.910
and replaces them with something much more
sinister.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:37.040
In fact all of Omega-5 regret what they have
been a part of and what they’ve done, all

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.270
except O5-1.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:44.449
The nine children can channel unprecedented
amounts of energy from an unknown origin that

00:07:44.449 --> 00:07:50.860
Omega-5 hypothesizes comes from an extradimensional
source, which is then used to unbind atoms

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.259
at the quantum level.

00:07:52.259 --> 00:07:56.690
When the right activation words are spoken,
it appears as though this tremendous power

00:07:56.690 --> 00:08:01.270
gives the children the ability to annihilate
anything in the entire universe.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.789
It’s the gun to end all guns.

00:08:04.789 --> 00:08:08.979
And only O5-1 has the key to control it.

00:08:08.979 --> 00:08:14.199
The nine children work so well within Item-001
that Omega-5 reclassifies it to include the

00:08:14.199 --> 00:08:16.330
nine children themselves.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:24.009
They are not just the entity housing or controlling
Item-001, they permanently become Item-001.

00:08:24.009 --> 00:08:28.530
Once Omega-5 has a better understanding of
Item-001, they begin to run tests to find

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:31.130
out the full extent of its abilities.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.690
First they test the distance Item-001 can
reach.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:38.920
The initial test that Omega-5 carries out
is on a steel rod placed 5 kilometers away.

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:42.300
O5-1 orders the children to destroy the target.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:45.820
Moments later the phone next to O5-1 begins
to ring.

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:49.560
When he picks it up the observer tasked with
watching the pole is on the other end.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:53.670
He informs O5-1 that the steel rod has been
completely vaporized.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.840
O5-1 is not satisfied though.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:09:01.350
He has another pole set out, this time placed
8,000 kilometers away from the nine children.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:05.190
O5-1 asks the children to destroy that rod.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.790
Almost immediately, the phone rings again.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.080
The target has been vaporized.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.580
O5-1 smiles.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:17.830
The next series of tests Omega-5 runs on Item-001
are to determine the maximum size of an object

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:19.130
that can be destroyed.

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:23.960
The tests start out with a steel sphere, 3
meters in diameter, placed 1,000 kilometers

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:24.960
from Item-001.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:28.520
O5-1 orders the children to destroy the object.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.790
It is instantly vaporized.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.510
O5-1 has seen enough small tests.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.660
It’s time for something big.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:39.810
So he does something that will later be questioned
by everyone at the SCP Foundation.

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:45.710
He orders the nine children to destroy a Church
of the Broken God worship site in Turkey.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:50.780
Not long after the destruction order is given
to Item-001, reports begin coming in.

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:56.130
The worship site has been obliterated with
no observable damage to the surrounding area.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:57.930
Deadly and precise.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:01.320
O5-1 closes his eyes and takes a deep breath.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:04.340
He looks as if he is overcome by an immense
spiritual experience.

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:10.410
He opens his eyes, leans over to the children,
and whispers the name of someone.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:15.520
Later that day, O5-1 finds out that the target
he had named has been vaporized.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:20.420
The success of Omega-5 and Item-001 is relayed
to the administration of the Foundation.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:25.780
They are so impressed that they make plans
to use Item-001 to eliminate the Abaddon threat

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.970
once and for all.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:32.850
However, one of the heads of the foundation,
Administrator Williams, has major concerns

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:35.951
about the way O5-1 is running the program.

00:10:35.951 --> 00:10:43.500
The updates that O5-1 has been sending have
become less scientific, and more philosophical…

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.940
more… spiritual.

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:50.500
Administrator Williams sends a letter to O5-1
reassuring him that he is doing good work,

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:55.380
but once the mission to destroy the Kingdom
of Abaddon is completed, O5-1 will be promoted

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:59.680
to director, and reassigned to the newly constructed
Site-19.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:04.900
For the good of the Foundation, and maybe
the world, he’ll be permanently moved away

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.110
from Item-001.

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:13.090
O5-1’s response is short and to the point,
“I am fine, Administrator.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:14.640
The project is finished.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.440
We will complete our task when you arrive.”

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:21.570
Administrator Williams arrives at Site-001
a few days later.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:25.450
He is greeted by O5-1 and the Omega-5 team.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:29.170
Williams can’t help but notice that O5-1
has a strange look in his eyes.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:35.770
It is the look of a crazed man who has been
lost in his work, and who has, perhaps, lost

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:37.120
himself.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:41.790
Williams puts the thought away though and
walks with O5-1 and his accompanying agents

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:47.330
to the viewing area where the powers of Item-001
will be demonstrated.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:51.930
Administrator Williams and the other agents
watch from a protected viewing room as O5-1

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:54.500
enters the chamber of his new super weapon.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:59.570
It’s time to see if their weapon that has
had so much time, effort, sweat, tears, and

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:03.690
especially blood poured into it, will have
been worth it.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:07.990
Everyone watches as O5-1 leans over and says
the name of the Abaddon Citadel to the nine

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.340
children.

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:11.390
All at once, they start to glow.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.830
No one observing can see what has happened
in the far off Kingdom, but they know something

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.130
big has happened.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:20.330
The administrator is thrilled, but notices
something.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:24.880
O5-1 hesitated a moment while leaning over
the children before standing back up.

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.460
Did he whisper something else to them?

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:31.840
And then Administrator Williams vaporizes,
pulled apart at an atomic level before he

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.460
has the chance to scream.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.200
What’s going on?

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:38.860
The agents standing next to where Administrator
Williams previously existed begin to yell

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.170
and pull out their guns.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:44.110
They burst through the door of the observation
room and run down the hallway towards where

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:47.030
O5-1 and the nine children are located.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.320
The armed agents rush into the room, but O5-1
is gone.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:53.770
The nine children are still.

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:58.960
Over the next few weeks O5-1 is reported to
be seen several times by SCP agents.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:02.820
However, no one is able to catch him, and
it appears as though other members of the

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:08.000
SCP Foundation have also gone AWOL as well,
perhaps joining him on the run.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:12.510
It is unclear what his plan is, but reports
from the reconnaissance team sent into the

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:16.470
Sahara make it obvious what the result of
his first command to the children was.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:21.710
There isn’t a single humanoid or building
left in the Kingdom of Abaddon.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:26.760
But even with this victory, the highest levels
of the SCP Foundation have an ominous thought

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.010
lurking in the back of their minds.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:33.310
Where did O5-1 go, and what is he planning
to do next?

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:38.250
Following the improper use of Item-001 leading
to the untimely death of a high ranking Foundation

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:44.480
Staff member, the weapon was deemed too dangerous
and containment procedures were implemented.

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:48.160
Due to the high amount of radiation they were
found to emit, the nine children were placed

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:53.290
into lead lined bags and buried under 50 meters
of concrete beneath the church of San Marcos

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.970
de la Vida Eterna.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:59.920
Though all of the children continue to be
functionally braindead, they still display

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:05.360
signs of life despite their containment, and
by order of the Overseer Council, have been

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.450
classified as a Thaumiel entity.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:14.990
Now go watch SCP-5000 - The Suit or SCP-1730
- What Happened at Site-13 for more epic tales

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:16.510
from the SCP archives.

